ons? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "An equilibrium is a constant function $y(t)=c$. Set $dy/dt=0$ and test the resulting equation.\n\nFirst keep the original domain: $y + 1\\ne0$.\n\nRearranging once, test whether $f(c)=0$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(c)= \\\\ 1 - \\frac{1}{\\left(c + 1\\right)^{2}}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\n- For $c=2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(2) &=- \\frac{1}{9} + 1 \\\\ &=\\frac{8}{9}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-2) &=-1 + 1 \\\\ &=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-3$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-3) &=- \\frac{1}{4} + 1 \\\\ &=\\frac{3}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=-2$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186748224 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16124f30-0b52-55e1-8a25-43384f85d48b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748213} {:answer/id #uuid "4d1ac8da-eb77-575e-855f-e69372ec73fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748248}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "16124f30-0b52-55e1-8a25-43384f85d48b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748213} :answer-field/id #uuid "377b8885-22b4-5248-a86b-8aca5515b22a" :answer-field/key "$y=-2$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748235} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4a5b15a9-3fe3-58bd-9873-09d0cdf5d109" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748245} {:answer/id #uuid "7c2b5dc0-6cfe-5c58-ba36-feab6cfc1f6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748272}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4a5b15a9-3fe3-58bd-9873-09d0cdf5d109" :answer/type {:db/ident