" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748230} {:answer/id #uuid "d645b0f6-ed6c-5ff7-a1e2-78e15ff11bd3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748344}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d645b0f6-ed6c-5ff7-a1e2-78e15ff11bd3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748344} :answer-field/id #uuid "87d79efe-91d0-534e-91c1-8043cd24e582" :answer-field/key "$y=1$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748282}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "9d79f37b-975e-5724-99c9-20f14836b61a" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\\frac{dy}{dt}= \\\\ \\left(y - e + 1\\right) \\ln{\\left(y + 1 \\right)}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following are equilibrium solutions? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "An equilibrium is a constant function $y(t)=c$. Set $dy/dt=0$ and test the resulting equation.\n\nFirst keep the original domain: $y + 1>0$.\n\nTest whether $f(c)=0$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(c)= \\\\ \\left(c - e + 1\\right) \\ln{\\left(c + 1 \\right)}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\n- For $c=1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(1)= \\\\ \\left(- e + 2\\right) \\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=0$: Use $\\ln{\\left(1 \\right)}=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(0)= \\\\ \\left(- e + 1\\right) \\ln{\\left(1 \\right)} \\\\ =0\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(2)= \\\\ \\left(- e + 3\\right) \\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-1$, $c + 1=0$ violates the original domain, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=0$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186748306 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e50d671-4a37-5676-80fa-6d801b85b90b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748217} {:answer/id #uuid "2279d241-bf67-51d8-97b5-a4b90dcfe740" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748220}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1e50d671-4a37-5676-80fa-6d801b85b90b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748217} :answer-field/id #uuid "4304d37a-d8b2-53e4-96af-2b9eb3c84d7f" :answer-field/key "$y=- \\pi$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748239} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a952e2c3-68f8-546e-ade9-3ef09f71678f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748309} {:answer/id #uuid "be0eaf59-64ce-5254-ab54-c7455a11131b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748323}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a952e2c3-68f8-546e-ade9-3ef09f71678f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748309} :answer-field/id #uuid "84d1f19c-c7fa-5669-a1ec-385f33d9039b" :answer-field/key "$y=0$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748276} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e613854-f168-58e4-ab89-b8ed2fa9ccba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748218} {:answer/id #uuid "f2092cb2-273b-5e27-ab96-445795ac3873" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748361}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f2092cb2-273b-5e27-ab96-445795ac3873" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748361} :answer-field/id #uuid "d2d3589b-2631-5da8-8025-907e4f3c8f22" :answer-field/key "$y=\\pi$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748342}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "a43b5bf3-6df3-53c4-be0b-ae5caac9b00d" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\\frac{dy}{dt}= \\\\ - y - \\sin{\\left(y \\right)} - \\pi\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following are equilibrium solutions? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "An equilibrium is a constant function $y(t)=c$. Set $dy/dt=0$ and test the resulting equation.\n\nTest whether $f(c)=0$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(c)= \\\\ - c - \\sin{\\left(c \\right)} - \\pi\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\n- For $c=0$: Use $\\sin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(0) &=- \\pi + 0 - \\sin{\\left(0 \\right)} \\\\ &=- \\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=- \\pi$: Use $\\sin{\\left(- \\pi \\right)}=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(- \\pi)= \\\\ - \\pi - \\sin{\\left(- \\pi \\right)} + \\pi \\\\ =0\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=\\pi$: Use $\\sin{\\left(\\pi \\right)}=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(\\pi)= \\\\ - \\pi - \\pi - \\sin{\\left(\\pi \\right)} \\\\ =- 2 \\pi\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=- \\pi$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186748320 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8764b9cc-6915-5233-8715-9eaeb6628a5b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748281} {:answer/id #uuid "db194aa7-909d-53b6-9439-1306a8957f30" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748349}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "db194aa7-909d-53b6-9439-1306a8957f30" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748349} :answer-field/id #uuid "6ccad5b0-78a1-56f1-adfd-b79a8730cc49" :answer-field/key "$y=3$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748265} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8faaa610-73fe-5875-949f-8fcb51af8bff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748292} {:answer/id #uuid "92074ae6-8208-56d4-a88c-ac57fb8798a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748296}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8faaa610-73fe-5875-949f-8fcb51af8bff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748292} :answer-field/id #uuid "83a60b17-c8d9-5ae3-8b29-42dfd3061910" :answer-field/key "$y=-3$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748274} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "62901ba9-ee89-514a-b4f8-c1b9569d329e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748259} {:answer/id #uuid "a1878343-9fb7-5daf-9676-a281df46d0c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748305}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "62901ba9-ee89-514a-b4f8-c1b9569d329e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748259} :answer-field/id #uuid "880539eb-c7c3-5d4a-958b-a3f8407f4262" :answer-field/key "$y=-2$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748283} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13096238-e687-5255-af19-4a50738a4e13" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748210} {:answer/id #uuid "17d46587-f1a3-5fd2-8397-52cfae64551e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748214}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "17d46587-f1a3-5fd2-8397-52cfae64551e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748214} :answer-field/id #uuid "906052da-d6f9-5bc8-b602-f5263b40a0a6" :answer-field/key "$y=0$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748295}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "b73355af-8562-58ac-92ab-a09e083ca7d0" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\\frac{dy}{dt}= \\\\ \\frac{y^{3} - y^{2} - 6 y}{y - 3}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following are equilibrium solutions? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "An equilibrium is a constant function $y(t)=c$. Set $dy/dt=0$ and test the resulting equation.\n\nFirst keep the original domain: $y - 3\\ne0$.\n\nTest whether $f(c)=0$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(c)= \\\\ \\frac{c^{3} - c^{2} - 6 c}{c - 3}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\n- For $c=-3$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-3) &=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=0$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(0) &=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-2) &=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=3$, $c - 3=0$ violates the original domain, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=0$ and $y=-2$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186748326 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b10d6571-e914-535b-910c-4208e33f02d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748317} {:answer/id #uuid "eee386d6-b920-53bb-b286-3358dbf4c1d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748360}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b10d6571-e914-535b-910c-4208e33f02d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748317} :answer-field/id #uuid "2b1dc939-0f88-5dc6-bd14-6fa82a81c7a4" :answer-field/key "$y=e$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748225} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4f66d9cb-592b-5f1e-8a2e-d89adb067962" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748250} {:answer/id #uuid "8e2ec4da-4630-509d-a362-8531b08e089c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748290}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8e2ec4da-4630-509d-a362-8531b08e089c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748290} :answer-field/id #uuid "806e85c3-856b-553e-84c9-7e7a24fe9bbb" :answer-field/key "$y=1$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748273} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0b51c9ba-3161-5336-a08d-0d964a836d4a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748208} {:answer/id #uuid "648e1857-5877-56a2-a751-22fb723f780d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748260}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0b51c9ba-3161-5336-a08d-0d964a836d4a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748208} :answer-field/id #uuid "d003e6c1-9966-5209-b39d-82ebb46979c5" :answer-field/key "$y=2$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748337}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c72d8feb-f5dd-59f4-b471-e2054392ae9f" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\\frac{dy}{dt}= \\\\ y^{2} \\ln{\\left(y \\right)} - e^{2}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following are equilibrium solutions? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "An equilibrium is a constant function $y(t)=c$. Set $dy/dt=0$ and test the resulting equation.\n\nFirst keep the original domain: $y>0$.\n\nTest whether $f(c)=0$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(c)= \\\\ c^{2} \\ln{\\left(c \\right)} - e^{2}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\n- For $c=e$: Use $\\ln{\\left(e \\right)}=1$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(e)= \\\\ - e^{2} + e^{2} \\ln{\\left(e \\right)} \\\\ =0\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(2) &=- e^{2} + 4 \\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=1$: Use $\\ln{\\left(1 \\right)}=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(1) &=- e^{2} + 1 \\ln{\\left(1 \\right)} \\\\ &=- e^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=e$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186748341 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5a7470e4-5e32-5567-a9a9-f0ba1926dd46" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748254} {:answer/id #uuid "8e21043d-b544-51fc-99d2-aac5f8e0993a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748289}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8e21043d-b544-51fc-99d2-aac5f8e0993a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748289} :answer-field/id #uuid "45093cc0-8745-5465-be48-1681b671e3ba" :answer-field/key "$y=3$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748241} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13f7d4f1-d94e-52d2-9986-3c649887cb2b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748211} {:answer/id #uuid "23b47a0c-1cbe-585b-84bc-1e074ef49f53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748222}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "23b47a0c-1cbe-585b-84bc-1e074ef49f53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748222} :answer-field/id #uuid "770be70e-b2d2-5356-975a-3ee2ef877647" :answer-field/key "$y=-3$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748270}