n{aligned}f(-3) &=- \\frac{15}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(2) &=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=3$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(3) &=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=1$, $c - 1=0$ violates the original domain, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=2$ and $y=3$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186748343 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "df68de34-735f-58eb-99f0-34449440fa8c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748350} {:answer/id #uuid "f3a84b65-cac6-55f0-a13f-8034e2dd4f89" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748366}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "df68de34-735f-58eb-99f0-34449440fa8c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748350} :answer-field/id #uuid "1f283174-91c2-58a8-99fc-44d4bb4a0102" :answer-field/key "$y=4$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748219} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d1af20c0-083f-55c9-827a-82238773ef5e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748339} {:answer/id #uuid "d6debdcf-0e52-5064-b8e8-09efb99b5e35" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748345}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d1af20c0-083f-55c9-827a-82238773ef5e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748339} :answer-field/id #uuid "2552fa73-7483-5558-a3b6-499c5a97898e" :answer-field/key "$y=-3$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748223} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3261267e-6d14-5566-934c-01cbc5add4d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748232} {:answer/id #uuid "ca70154b-86d7-5b08-ac62-9daac0db77f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748332}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3261267e-6d14-5566-934c-01cbc5add4d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748232} :answer-field/id #uuid "7a1d2ab6-f1a5-586e-884a-21bf9f4bcc9e" :answer-field/key "$y=-2$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748271} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "07397297-147c-5135-b4cc-aca8e38c237d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748205} {:answer/id #uuid "8ffad2a9-b62c-5ff4-a694-341d2837e66e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748293}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8ffad2a9-b62c-5ff4-a694-341d2837e66e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748293} :answer-field/id #uuid "f33cff65-7bc3-5202-8422-90e2a4909d84" :answer-field/key "$y=1$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748365}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "d3cee2a6-f129-5d27-af14-edfba3e17138" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\\frac{dy}{dt}= \\\\ \\frac{y^{2} + y - 2}{y - 1}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following are equilibrium solutions? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "An equilibrium is a constant function $y(t)=c$. Set $dy/dt=0$ and test the resulting equation.\n\nFirst keep the original domain: $y - 1\\ne0$.\n\nTest whether $f(c)=0$, where\n\n$$\nf(c) = \\frac{c^{2} + c - 2}{c - 1}\n$$\n\n- For $c=-2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-2) &=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=1$, $c - 1=0$ violates the original domain, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-3$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-3) &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=4$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(4) &=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=-2$."}] :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Equilibrium Solutions of a Differential Equation"}]}
